    "body": "## Summary\n\n`TRTLLMHAAttnBackend` inherited from `FlashInferAttnBackend` but reused very little from it. Almost all attention-specific behavior is overridden, and some inherited setup was allocated-but-never-used.\n\nThis PR changes the base class to `AttentionBackend` directly, inlining the only 4 attributes actually used from the old parent's `__init__`:\n- `token_to_kv_pool`\n- `kv_index_translator`\n- `kv_cache_quant_method`\n- `use_sliding_window_kv_pool` (via the overridden `_resolve_swa_kv_pool`)\n\nIt also moves `_kv_write_scales` (the single non-overridden parent method still called by this backend) into the class.\n\nZero behavior change — pure refactoring.\n\nResolves #28808.\n\nSigned-off-by: bantianyue <bantianyue@gmail.com>\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40797016178](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40797016178)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40797017269](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40797017269)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40797016521](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40797016521)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
